  "reviewNotes": [
    "This contract follows Order 747n effective 2026-01-10; do not use repealed Order 1130n routing as the current clinical workflow.",
    "The surviving 1130n appendices 7-9 are form/protocol dependencies, not the current care-order logic.",
    "The second-trimester order window is 18+0 to 20+6, while the ultrasound component is described as 19-21 weeks; both source expressions are preserved instead of being silently collapsed.",
